These compile-only interface stubs mirror the public shape of fabric-loader's
net.fabricmc.api entrypoint interfaces for building self-authored UMB fixtures.

The interfaces are one abstract method each, redeclared from the published API.
They are not copied source from FabricMC, carry no implementation, and are
distributed only inside this repository's test fixtures (CC0-1.0 like the
fixtures they build). At runtime the real interfaces always come from
fabric-loader itself; these stubs never ship in any artifact.
